00:35:46.840 --> 00:35:51.800
And I, I can see how that can feel, uh, uh, what's the word?

00:35:52.520 --> 00:35:53.500
Satisfying to others.

00:35:54.360 --> 00:36:05.060
Yeah, I actually played a lot of this, um, and I was significantly worse at it than I was at the other game, but it was very, there was just something like enticing about, about exactly what you just said, Sean.

00:36:05.060 --> 00:36:12.500
Like, there's like this major obstacle in the way that this, the, these bricks or whatever blocks are randomly laid out.

00:36:12.620 --> 00:36:19.340
And it's like, it was very satisfying when I was able to like really, um, make a dent in, in that.

00:36:20.120 --> 00:36:22.200
Like that, yeah, there was something cathartic about it.

00:36:22.720 --> 00:36:28.020
