00:39:38.780 --> 00:39:52.620
The, the, the extra intricacies here of being able to see what block comes next and, um, being able to choose which speed the blocks fall and the, and the, uh, the amount of clears required before it increases in speed.

00:39:52.900 --> 00:40:00.960
